OL,3,GNEWSA'I've kept a spreadsheet of fuel
OL,4,Aprices for 16 years'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPetrol prices are now at their highest
OL,7,Flevel since November 2022 - and the ups
OL,8,Fand downs of fuel hikes are a familiar
OL,9,Fsubject of fascination for Rebecca
OL,10,FCook.
OL,12,FThe tearoom owner from York has kept a
OL,13,Fspreadsheet of what she has paid to
OL,14,Ffill her tank for the past 16 years,
OL,15,Fand can track global market shocks such
OL,16,Fas the Covid lockdowns, the war in
OL,17,FUkraine and recent unrest in Iran.
OL,19,F"It's interesting how quickly prices
OL,20,Fcan shoot up (in the UK)," she says.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
